id: pm-4f86c4
title: Compact default list receipts and avoid repeated recovery argument echoes
description: "GitHub source https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1251. GitHub reports 31 output lines for a complete three-item default list and repeated long argument values in missing-id recovery. Historical explicit compact-mode trimming is already shipped; this report concerns default rendering and conditional receipt retention."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-12T22:29:49.674Z"
