author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: A complete default three-item list uses approximately six lines; incomplete and truncated reads preserve actionable receipts; structured full output remains available; missing-id recovery does not repeat long argument values.
goal: project management = context management
objective: Compact default list receipts and avoid repeated recovery argument echoes
value: Lower agent recovery cost and preserve safe customizable SDK composition
parent: pm-mpbb
resolution: "Complete brief lists are compact while producer-owned diagnostics, incomplete receipts, and full JSON remain intact."
expected_result: "Complete brief lists are compact while producer-owned diagnostics, incomplete receipts, and full JSON remain intact."
actual_result: "All 8809 tests and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage pass, together with relevant static, type, SDK, recovery, token, packed npm/Bun, and manual package acceptance. See PR #1254 for the immutable hosted-review and merge evidence."
