comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-12T22:29:49.674Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: live full all-status export contained 2751 items with no omitted rows. Request-specific CLI searches and full historical metadata distinguished the existing shipped predecessor from this new report. Reuse its typed lineage; leave this intake open and unclaimed because implementation is not active."
  "2026-09-13T09:21:04.529Z","harness:codex","TDD and acceptance evidence: the initial regression run failed the expected new assertions before implementation. Connected focused suite now passes 144 tests. A temporary initialized workspace installed the published pm-ops package and executed ops metrics beside core ops health; three-item default list is six lines and start guidance retains claim --start. Full coverage and hosted validation remain pending. Live Sentry 14-day threshold read is accessible with zero blocking issues; required telemetry gate passes with 2.21 percent finish error rate and no missing error-code rows. This aggregate gate is not per-action correlation proof."
  "2026-09-13T09:46:00.390Z","harness:codex","Final source verification: all 683 test files and 8808 tests passed. Exact all-source coverage is 100/100/100/100: statements 64355/64355, branches 49089/49089, functions 13372/13372, lines 61640/61640. No thresholds or exclusions were weakened. Static code, documentation, duplicate, contract, SDK surface, and performance checks passed; the initial graph prose-reference failure was corrected with typed relationships, then graph and record-integrity assurance passed. Packed consumer and hosted review evidence remain pending."
  "2026-09-13T09:49:51.095Z","harness:codex","Final local acceptance passed: context evaluation and 57 token surfaces; npx/bunx packed package smoke; separate npm and Bun tarball consumers exercising SDK canonicalization, initialization, mutations, six-line TOON, and full JSON; package-first authoring dogfood; compatibility migration with health and validation true. Reviewed delivery closure captures implementation and local verification; GitHub checks, bot review, merge, and publication are separate pending claims."
  "2026-09-13T10:03:50.414Z","harness:codex","Local review negative control: adding producer-owned details to a real complete list lost that diagnostic in TOON. A new regression failed before the fix (11 passed, 1 failed). Compact projection now leaves producer-owned details and its envelope intact; strict JSON is unchanged. Reopened only this item while actively implementing the correction, to batch it with the first GitHub feedback round."
  "2026-09-13T10:29:57.594Z","harness:codex","Corrected delivery verification: 683 files and 8809 tests pass with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage (64360 statements, 49095 branches, 13372 functions, 61645 lines; zero uncovered). Static quality, type checks, SDK snapshot, docs links, refusal and agent-task token gates, npx/bunx smoke, independent npm/Bun packed SDK consumers, and published pm-ops manual acceptance all pass. First-head GitHub checks and hosted analyzers passed; all available first-round reports were acknowledged. Live review and merge evidence is maintained on https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1254."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-13T10:14:05.879Z","harness:codex",A formatter accepting extensible producer objects must preserve producer-owned metadata keys. A compact recovery pointer may only use an unoccupied field; verify this with real list envelopes carrying custom diagnostics.
